{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forefront \u2013 The Next Evolution of VR Warfare</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of <strong>Breachers</strong> and <strong>Hyper Dash</strong>, <strong>Forefront</strong> delivers an <strong>all-out war experience like never before</strong> in VR. Engage in <strong>massive 32-player battles</strong> across a variety of expansive, semi-destructible environments, where strategy, skill, and teamwork decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/f37d051b3b0ed0e81b3ca2d5662556dc.poster.avif?t=1759406395\" width=640 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/f37d051b3b0ed0e81b3ca2d5662556dc.webm?t=1759406395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/f37d051b3b0ed0e81b3ca2d5662556dc.mp4?t=1759406395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude81 <strong>Command land, sea, and air vehicles</strong> \u2013 Pilot helicopters, drive tanks, and storm objectives in humvees and boats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/ce48d944c2561676f881ce05be3ebf5d.poster.avif?t=1759406395\" width=640 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/ce48d944c2561676f881ce05be3ebf5d.webm?t=1759406395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/ce48d944c2561676f881ce05be3ebf5d.mp4?t=1759406395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Choose your class</strong> \u2013 Play as Assault, Engineer, Medic, or Sniper, each with specialized weapons and gadgets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/3f7359c2c89118ed6db47b673ffff98b.poster.avif?t=1759406395\" width=640 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/3f7359c2c89118ed6db47b673ffff98b.webm?t=1759406395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/3f7359c2c89118ed6db47b673ffff98b.mp4?t=1759406395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Feel the impact</strong> \u2013 Realistic gunplay, tactical movement, and large-scale combat bring the battlefield to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/2c99c5fb5d9a7a0b7f0e7839a98d8443.poster.avif?t=1759406395\" width=640 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/2c99c5fb5d9a7a0b7f0e7839a98d8443.webm?t=1759406395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/2c99c5fb5d9a7a0b7f0e7839a98d8443.mp4?t=1759406395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Shape the fight</strong> \u2013 Blast through walls, and use destruction to create new paths or deny enemy cover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/f0b00df9e9f03ad345d20f67cb070574.poster.avif?t=1759406395\" width=640 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/f0b00df9e9f03ad345d20f67cb070574.webm?t=1759406395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/f0b00df9e9f03ad345d20f67cb070574.mp4?t=1759406395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is <strong>2035</strong>. A powerful energy corporation, O.R.E., has built a private military to defend its <strong>monopoly on Red Orpiment, a rare mineral set to power the world</strong>, while local governments and resistance fighters battle to reclaim control. You are the tip of the spear in the war to control it\u2014<strong>which side will you take?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong> Playtests begin this summer!</strong><br>\ud83d\udccc <strong>Wishlist now to be the first to fight!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd17 <strong>Join our community:</strong> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2981220?t=1759406395","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/8b96edb0e697e32c75e37f4e9e0142299ae860c8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759406395","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/0422424c7a64755a88532003876fd7517e3ca86e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759406395","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/0422424c7a64755a88532003876fd7517e3ca86e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759406395","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Forefront depicts modern warfare and includes realistic weapons as well as vehicles for warfare such as tanks and attack helicopters"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forefront \u2013 The Next Evolution of VR Warfare</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of <strong>Breachers</strong> and <strong>Hyper Dash</strong>, <strong>Forefront</strong> delivers an <strong>all-out war experience like never before</strong> in VR. Engage in <strong>massive 32-player battles</strong> across a variety of expansive, semi-destructible environments, where strategy, skill, and teamwork decide the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/f37d051b3b0ed0e81b3ca2d5662556dc.poster.avif?t=1759406395\" width=640 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/f37d051b3b0ed0e81b3ca2d5662556dc.webm?t=1759406395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/f37d051b3b0ed0e81b3ca2d5662556dc.mp4?t=1759406395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude81 <strong>Command land, sea, and air vehicles</strong> \u2013 Pilot helicopters, drive tanks, and storm objectives in humvees and boats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/ce48d944c2561676f881ce05be3ebf5d.poster.avif?t=1759406395\" width=640 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/ce48d944c2561676f881ce05be3ebf5d.webm?t=1759406395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/ce48d944c2561676f881ce05be3ebf5d.mp4?t=1759406395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83d\udd2b <strong>Choose your class</strong> \u2013 Play as Assault, Engineer, Medic, or Sniper, each with specialized weapons and gadgets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/3f7359c2c89118ed6db47b673ffff98b.poster.avif?t=1759406395\" width=640 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/3f7359c2c89118ed6db47b673ffff98b.webm?t=1759406395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/3f7359c2c89118ed6db47b673ffff98b.mp4?t=1759406395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Feel the impact</strong> \u2013 Realistic gunplay, tactical movement, and large-scale combat bring the battlefield to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/2c99c5fb5d9a7a0b7f0e7839a98d8443.poster.avif?t=1759406395\" width=640 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/2c99c5fb5d9a7a0b7f0e7839a98d8443.webm?t=1759406395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/2c99c5fb5d9a7a0b7f0e7839a98d8443.mp4?t=1759406395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Shape the fight</strong> \u2013 Blast through walls, and use destruction to create new paths or deny enemy cover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/f0b00df9e9f03ad345d20f67cb070574.poster.avif?t=1759406395\" width=640 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/f0b00df9e9f03ad345d20f67cb070574.webm?t=1759406395\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/extras/f0b00df9e9f03ad345d20f67cb070574.mp4?t=1759406395\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is <strong>2035</strong>. A powerful energy corporation, O.R.E., has built a private military to defend its <strong>monopoly on Red Orpiment, a rare mineral set to power the world</strong>, while local governments and resistance fighters battle to reclaim control. You are the tip of the spear in the war to control it\u2014<strong>which side will you take?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong> Playtests begin this summer!</strong><br>\ud83d\udccc <strong>Wishlist now to be the first to fight!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd17 <strong>Join our community:</strong> </p>","developers":["Triangle Factory"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981220/bf26e94db0d5bac9fc1f1d07f332c76e661d689e/header.jpg?t=1759406395","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2981220/563748012/8314c25b5451ce2808ca6af8e423d49f59f8455c/1756214904/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756980245","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2981220/563748012/8314c25b5451ce2808ca6af8e4